<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 10,740 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 3,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  202   (183 and 191)</p>
<p>    Good		130   (132 and 170)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     125   (125 and 128)</p>
<p>    Medium	    114   (116 and 100)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	unq   (unq and  85)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 202 pence for a Rwanda PD.</p>
</text>
